WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0101: a crash says which effects were being replayed.

The GPU fault at camp's door logged when and what kind, not which draw. BG3's shaders run through passthrough,
without wgpu's checks, so they are the suspects. The last 240 frames' draws go to Diagnostics/fx-trail.txt from
the panic hook. Each line is built once per BG3 frame.

